Quest 536 "[Long Revenge/Boss] Revenge vs. Revenge"
    Journal for karus "You must get rid of Grendel's mother by following [Captain] Fargo's order at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must get rid of Grendel's mother by following [Captain] Falkwine's order at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 1 of 910196000

Requires player level >= 61 and quest 535 is completed

Rewards
    Give 37500000 experience
    Give 150 np
    Give 2 of 900017000

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "When you are ready, battle master, [Captain]Harugo, and you have to go back to God. To give a big mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "When you are ready, battle master, Captain] Falkwine, to God, you have to go back. To give a big mission."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "Combat readiness is all done?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "<selfname>!  command. Get rid of Grendel's mother, invading the personal threat to the King by Luferson Castle raid killed his loyal load!\n\nDefeat [Grendel's Mother] and bring the hair following the order of [Captain] Fargo."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Combat readiness is all done?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "<selfname>!  command.Get rid of Grendel's mother killed the raid El Morad, invading the personal threat to the King and his loyal load!\n\nDefeat [Grendel's Mother] and bring the hair following the order of [Captain] Falkwine."

On in_progress
    Say "Must be still! Luck luck!"

On claimable
    Show quest "You must soothe the ghost, loyal soldiers died of that. Thank you, Chief."
